 AI, Steals Data From 18 Agents and About 100 Users</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/MSNightmare/SignDrop\">SignDrop Windows Common Log FileSystem Authentication 0day Local Privilege Escalation Vulnerability</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.hacktivesecurity.com/blog/2026/11/05/digging-into-html-to-find-more-elements-and-event-handlers-for-xss-attacks/\">Digging into HTML to find more elements and event handlers for XSS attacks</a>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://xca-attacks.github.io/mior/mior_ccs26.pdf\">Mior: Breaking AMD SEV-SNP with Device-as-Memory</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://research.checkpoint.com/2026/php2shell-exploitation-on-check-point-gateway/\">PHP2Shell Exploitation on Check Point Gateway</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.wiz.io/blog/qubole-cross-account-access-abused-in-the-wild\">Trusted by Default: Qubole Cross-Account Access Abused in the Wild</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://cursor.com/blog/security-incident-update\">Cursor An update on our recent security incident</a> </p><p><a href=\"https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/hackers-exploit-n-central-flaws-to.html\">Hackers Exploit N-central Flaws to Infect 21 Servers, Including 19 Running Hotfix 2</a></p><p><strong>Intelligence and Information Warfare</strong> &nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/ck5ynnj05z8no\">What happens if all the lights go out? This is the plan for a ‘Black Sky’ event</a>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://malbearlabs.com/posts/operation-snowball-inside-an-autonomous-ai-intrusion-campaign\">Operation Snowball: Inside an Autonomous AI Intrusion Campaign</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.ft.com/content/1397e2f4-d7f5-4cbb-a4d9-04ecf661d1aa\">Nvidia’s Jensen Huang admits to affair after allegations of relationship with Chinese spy</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.acronis.com/en/tru/posts/bossai-inside-the-ai-attack-mesh-that-targeted-taiwans-emergency-services/\">BOSSAI: Inside the AI attack mesh that targeted Taiwan’s emergency